"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/050e4eb969c843182b48089f9688ebca.avif?t=1786106932\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras_big/050e4eb969c843182b48089f9688ebca.webp?t=1786106932 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURRENT CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A complete single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A main lobby where you choose your missions and track your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 7 unique levels, each featuring its own boss encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dozens of different targets and objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 45 achievements to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A ranking system to compare your scores and challenge yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is designed around replayability, encouraging players to improve their accuracy, optimize their strategy, and chase higher scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/8ef8d23e3d05a7c70b5be77347d30ae9.poster.avif?t=1786106932\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/8ef8d23e3d05a7c70b5be77347d30ae9.webm?t=1786106932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/8ef8d23e3d05a7c70b5be77347d30ae9.mp4?t=1786106932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUTURE DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, we plan to expand the game with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• New levels and special seasonal content (Halloween, Christmas, and more).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Additional bosses and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• New customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• More achievements and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• We are also exploring future multiplayer possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Continued improvements based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Controller compatibility improvements</strong> : we will continue refining weapon alignment for different VR controllers (Valve Index, HTC Vive, PICO, ...) to ensure the most natural aiming experience across supported headsets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/de8c08436c5c576e075e436751d911cd.poster.avif?t=1786106932\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/de8c08436c5c576e075e436751d911cd.webm?t=1786106932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/extras/de8c08436c5c576e075e436751d911cd.mp4?t=1786106932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Saddle up, cowboy! Wild West Panic is a hyper-casual VR arcade shooter: grab a WANTED poster, hunt your target, and cash in the bounty. Replay endlessly to beat your high score, but whatever you do, don't shoot the innocent, or it'll cost you dearly! Have fun, bounty hunter!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/f084308fed227c85ca8077a390002c223855b769/header.jpg?t=1786106932", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165710/bd40d035303c2086b06b28a138e5e44a1497cad1/capsule_231